              description: "coordinator-git has 0% of its graphql pool left — consumers of this installation will start erroring \"API rate limit exceeded\" when it reaches 0; the pool resets at github_rate_limit_reset_timestamp."
      # the mechanical port: the oldest sample in each window is the biggest, so its condition
      # only turns true at 55m and it pages at 60m — by which time the pool has been empty for 10m
      - eval_time: 52m
        alertname: GithubRateLimitLowMaxDirection
